:''For the other Mari from the same Gacha, see [[Mari Illustrious (Super Rare Cat)]].''
'''Mari Cat''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 6.10 Update|Version 6.10]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Neon Genesis Evangelion Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 408
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Mari Cat
|name2 = Special Ops Mari
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Special Ops Mari''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Although Mari Cat is one of the few Rare Cats with resistance to Floating enemies, she is mostly outclassed by stronger anti-Floating meatshields like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kotatsu Cat]] or [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]]. However, Mari Cat can be used in 4-crown lineups, where she may be useful in stages dominated by Floating units such as [[I'm onto you]]. If you use her as so, it is recommended to use Research Up [[Cat Combo|cat combos]] like Biohazard and Bony Bone in order to make her more spammable.

{{Job|Classification = Meatshield}}

